title: Neorevisionist leaders resign
new-page: true 
subtitle: Reformist disagreements with our policies have grown too severe.
tags: event
view-if: not neorev_resign and ((spd_centrist and neorevisionist_dissent >= 70) or (not spd_centrist and neorevisionist_dissent >= 60))
on-arrival: neorevisionist_strength *= 0.3; workers_spd -= 10; workers_others += 5; neorev_resign = 1

= Neorevisionist leaders resign

Our policy choices have greatly offended the Neorevisionist faction. Many of our most experienced leaders have resigned.
